          "_name": "article17",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article17\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#b7b3ef\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"></h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>Tara Lunar Soulmate Sketch™ was developed by Master Tara Winslow, a spiritual mentor and astrologer known for her experience in Eastern astrology and intuitive practices spanning more than three decades. She serves as the guiding inspiration behind the program, using her knowledge of birth charts, planetary movements, and spiritual interpretation to help shape each personalized soulmate reading.<div><br></div><div>Although Tara Winslow is presented as the primary figure and visionary of the service, only limited public information is available about her personal history or the full team working alongside her. Based on customer feedback, it appears that a group of intuitive artists and support staff assist in creating the sketches and accompanying materials, while Tara oversees the overall direction and methodology.</div><div><br></div><div>Her philosophy combines ancient astrological traditions with modern digital tools, making the experience both mystical and convenient for today’s users. Many customers appreciate the emotional insight and sense of connection the readings provide, while others express curiosity about the program’s transparency and credentials.</div><div><br></div><div>Despite varying opinions, Master Tara Winslow remains the central force behind My Soulmate Profile™, attracting individuals who are drawn to a spiritually inspired and imaginative approach to discovering love.</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
