        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article11",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article11\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n       <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">        \n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-0 mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Nitric Boost Ultra™ | Official Site</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">When you purchase Tara Lunar Soulmate Sketch™, you receive a personalized digital package created to give you insight, inspiration, and guidance on your path to love. By combining intuitive interpretation with astrological principles, each element is designed to help you better understand your romantic energy and the type of partner you may naturally connect with.<div><br></div><div>Here’s what’s typically included:</div><div><br></div><div><b>Hand-Drawn Soulmate Sketch</b></div><div>A custom illustration of your potential soulmate, created by an intuitive artist. The sketch is inspired by your personal details and energetic profile, offering a visual representation meant to capture both physical features and emotional presence.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Personalized Voice Profile</b></div><div>A tailored audio recording that describes your soulmate’s personality, emotional qualities, and the type of bond you may share. This feature helps bring depth and character to the overall experience, making the connection feel more real and relatable.</div><div><br></div><div><b>12-Month Love Forecast</b></div><div>An astrology-based outlook that highlights key periods for romance, growth, and new opportunities over the coming year. This guide is intended to help you recognize favorable timing for meaningful relationships.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Zodiac Compatibility Insights</b></div><div>A compatibility overview explaining how your zodiac traits may align with your soulmate’s. It outlines potential strengths, challenges, and emotional dynamics within the relationship.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Divine Love Calendar</b></div><div>A guided calendar filled with gentle prompts such as affirmations, reflective exercises, or suggested actions. These tools are designed to help you stay focused, positive, and open to attracting love.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Follow-Up Guidance</b></div><div>Ongoing emails with additional tips, insights, and supportive advice to keep you aligned with your relationship goals and personal growth.</div><div><br></div><div>The entire package is prepared under the guidance of Master Tara Winslow and is usually delivered within 24 hours via email or a secure online portal. While many users find the experience uplifting and meaningful, results can vary from person to person. Your overall experience will depend largely on how open you are to intuitive and astrological approaches to love.</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Learn more\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
