          "_name": "article11",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article11\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n       <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">        \n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-0 mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Nitric Boost Ultra™ | Official Site</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">Tara Lunar Soulmate Sketch™ combines elements of Eastern astrology, intuitive interpretation, and spiritual traditions to deliver its personalized love readings. While many users describe the experience as engaging and emotionally meaningful, it’s important to understand that the service is based on metaphysical beliefs rather than established scientific principles. Its methods fall outside the scope of evidence-based research and cannot be objectively verified through modern science.<div><br></div><div><b>Astrology and Scientific Evidence</b></div><div>A central part of the program involves astrology, particularly systems inspired by Eastern traditions such as Vedic or Chinese astrology. Birth dates, planetary positions, and celestial alignments are used to create what the service calls a “soulprint”—a symbolic blueprint meant to represent your romantic compatibility and destiny.</div><div><br></div><div>However, scientific studies have not found reliable evidence that astrology can predict personality traits or relationship outcomes. Research has consistently shown that the positions of planets and stars have no measurable effect on human behavior or compatibility. As a result, astrological insights are generally considered interpretive or symbolic rather than factual or predictive.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Psychic Interpretation and Verification</b></div><div>Another key feature of My Soulmate Profile™ involves psychic or intuitive channeling. Artists and readers claim to tap into spiritual energies to create soulmate sketches and personalized profiles. Despite decades of testing, there is no consistent scientific proof supporting the existence of psychic abilities such as clairvoyance or energy reading.</div><div><br></div><div>Perceived accuracy in these readings may be explained by psychological factors. For example, the Barnum effect describes how people tend to see vague, positive statements as highly personal and specific. Descriptions like “kind,” “passionate,” or “emotionally deep” can easily apply to many individuals, which can create the impression of precision even when the information is broad.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Emotional and Psychological Benefits</b></div><div>Although the service lacks scientific validation, it may still offer emotional value. Experiences like receiving a soulmate sketch or reading a love forecast can spark hope, self-reflection, and optimism. These feelings may encourage users to approach relationships with greater confidence and openness.</div><div><br></div><div>Positive psychology suggests that mindset, belief, and intention can influence behavior. Feeling inspired or hopeful may indirectly improve how someone communicates, socializes, or pursues relationships. However, these benefits are not exclusive to psychic services and can also come from proven practices like journaling, coaching, therapy, or mindfulness exercises.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Accuracy Claims and Success Stories</b></div><div>From a scientific perspective, claims such as high accuracy rates or large numbers of success stories are difficult to verify independently. Concepts like “meeting your soulmate” are subjective and emotionally defined, which makes them hard to measure or test using objective standards. Without transparent data or controlled studies, such figures should be viewed as promotional rather than scientific.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Science vs. Spiritual Experience</b></div><div>Evidence-based relationship research focuses on measurable factors such as communication skills, shared values, emotional intelligence, and attachment styles. These elements have been shown to play a much stronger role in long-term compatibility than astrological or psychic interpretations.</div><div><br></div><div>In contrast, My Soulmate Profile™ offers more of a symbolic or spiritual journey. It is designed to inspire and guide rather than scientifically predict outcomes.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Final Perspective</b></div><div>Ultimately, My Soulmate Profile™ is best understood as a mystical and emotionally driven experience rather than a scientifically validated service. For those who enjoy spiritual exploration and intuitive guidance, it may feel meaningful and uplifting. For individuals seeking evidence-based relationship advice, it’s wise to approach the program with realistic expectations and view it as entertainment or inspiration rather than factual prediction.</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Learn more\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
