          "_name": "article17",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article17\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#9fe870\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">Discover a fresh and exciting way to explore your romantic future. Soulmate Story is designed to inspire hope, spark curiosity, and give you a deeper understanding of the love that may be waiting for you.</h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n          <ol>\n            <li><b>Vivid Connection to Your Potential Partner :</b>&nbsp;Tara Lunar Soulmate Sketch™ provides a deeply personal glimpse into your future love through a custom hand-drawn sketch and a tailored voice profile. Created using intuitive interpretation and astrological insights, these features are designed to make your soulmate feel more familiar and real. Many users say this visual and emotional connection sparks excitement and anticipation, helping them feel more connected to their romantic journey.</li>\n            <li><b>Astrological Roadmap for Love :</b>&nbsp;The program includes tools such as a 12-month love forecast and zodiac compatibility insights based on your birth chart. These features act like a guided roadmap, highlighting favorable times for romance and offering clues about the qualities that may best match your personality. By aligning your intentions with these cycles, you can approach relationships with greater clarity and confidence.</li>\n            <li><b>Emotional Inspiration and Clarity :</b>&nbsp;One of the strongest benefits of My Soulmate Profile™ is the emotional boost it provides. The experience encourages self-reflection, mindfulness, and a positive outlook on love. Resources like the Divine Love Calendar help you stay focused on your goals, and many users report feeling more hopeful, motivated, and open to new connections.</li>\n            <li><b>Practical Tools for Manifestation :</b>&nbsp;Beyond symbolic insights, the program offers simple, actionable guidance to help you take steps toward attracting love. Follow-up emails, affirmations, meditation suggestions, and timing tips encourage you to actively participate in your journey rather than waiting passively. These tools help transform intention into meaningful action.</li>\n            <li><b>A Unique and Spiritual Experience :</b>&nbsp;Unlike traditional dating apps or matchmaking services, My Soulmate Profile™ takes a more mystical and creative approach. By blending astrology, intuition, and spirituality, it offers a one-of-a-kind experience that feels both imaginative and personal. For those drawn to spiritual exploration, it can turn the search for love into a deeper journey of self-discovery and possibility.</li>\n          </ol>\n          <ol>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
