          "_name": "article11",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article11\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n       <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">        \n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-0 mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Nitric Boost Ultra™ | Official Site</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">Tara Lunar Soulmate Sketch™ is created for people who are open to exploring love through spiritual, intuitive, and symbolic guidance. If you feel drawn to astrology, energy readings, or the idea that the universe may influence your romantic path, this program is likely to resonate with you.<div><br></div><div>It can be especially appealing for those who feel tired of traditional dating apps or modern matchmaking methods and want a more meaningful, heart-centered approach to relationships. Instead of endless swiping, the experience offers a creative and reflective way to think about love, connection, and compatibility.</div><div><br></div><div>The program is also well suited for individuals who value emotional growth and self-discovery. If you want to better understand what you truly desire in a partner, build confidence in your romantic life, or feel more hopeful about meeting someone special, features like the soulmate sketch, voice profile, and love forecasts can provide inspiration and clarity.</div><div><br></div><div>Spiritually curious adults of any age or background may enjoy the journey—especially those who practice mindfulness, meditation, manifestation, or compatibility exploration. For many, the experience feels uplifting, imaginative, and personally meaningful.</div><div><br></div><div>However, My Soulmate Profile™ may not be the right fit for everyone. If you prefer strictly scientific or evidence-based approaches to relationships, or if you’re highly skeptical of astrology and intuitive practices, the methods may feel unconvincing. It’s also not designed for those expecting instant or guaranteed results.</div><div><br></div><div>Overall, it’s best suited for open-minded individuals who see love as both an emotional and spiritual journey and want a unique, reflective way to explore it.</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Learn more\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
