          "_name": "article11",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article11\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n       <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">        \n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-0 mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Nitric Boost Ultra™ | Official Site</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">To get the most value from Tara Lunar Soulmate Sketch™, approach it as a tool for insight and self-reflection rather than a prediction of fixed outcomes. The real benefit comes from how thoughtfully you engage with the guidance provided.<div><br></div><div>Start by reviewing your soulmate sketch, voice profile, and astrological insights with an open mind. Instead of focusing only on literal details, consider the emotional qualities, personality traits, and relationship themes highlighted. These can help you better understand your own preferences, needs, and patterns in love.</div><div><br></div><div>Next, use the 12-month love forecast and Divine Love Calendar as gentle guides. Pay attention to suggested periods for growth, openness, or connection. During these times, take positive action—such as meeting new people, journaling your intentions, practicing mindfulness, or improving communication skills.</div><div><br></div><div>When connecting with potential partners, focus on deeper compatibility rather than surface attraction alone. Let the experience encourage meaningful conversations about shared values, emotional alignment, and long-term goals. Trust both your intuition and real-world interactions.</div><div><br></div><div>Finally, revisit your profile over time. As you grow and change, your understanding of love may evolve too. Treat the insights as ongoing support for personal awareness and emotional development.</div><div><br></div><div>When used mindfully, My Soulmate Profile™ becomes more than just a digital product—it becomes a thoughtful guide that encourages clarity, growth, and a more intentional approach to finding love.</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Learn more\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
